OL,3,GNEWSAWoman shocked by Aldi's AI
OL,4,Aresponse to complaint
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who found hairs in her Aldi dip
OL,7,Fhas said she was disappointed the
OL,8,Fcompany included an AI prompt in its
OL,9,Freply when she complained.
OL,11,FJo Reeves from Cotteridge in Birmingham
OL,12,Fsaid she found the "vile" hairs when
OL,13,Fshe popped out for a snack, while her
OL,14,Fpartner was in hospital.
OL,16,FThe AI prompt included the phrase:
OL,17,F"Make it short and concise but do not
OL,18,Foverdo it" and Reeves said: "Everyone
OL,19,Fuses AI but the language is
OL,20,Fdisappointing as a customer.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
