OL,3,GNEWSAWoman shocked by Aldi's AI
OL,4,Aresponse to complaint
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Aldi spokesperson said: "This
OL,7,Fresponse fell well below our normal
OL,8,Fstandards of customer service. We have
OL,9,Fcontacted Ms Reeves directly to
OL,10,Fapologise and fully resolve the issue
OL,11,Fshe had with our product."
